Z||000007||qwikgta||09-12-2001||11:56 AM||||blo... are you talking about the plactic stuff that is full of little 1/2 - 3/4 squares.  I have a sheet of it too, only chrome,  I am going to put if behind (light side) too.  You can see it behing the diffuser plastic and it is real chrome plate so it glows bright.  <P>As for the edge, I painted the inside of the lights cover with flat black paint, of course I masked off the area i didnt want painted, and i extended it down about 1/2 inch so it covers the area of the edge. <P>Pics soon<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header no Cat, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar, open element air cleaner, hood vents.<BR>http://www.homestead.com/robsfieroproject   <BR>http://www.vafieros.com<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
